The `SpeechRecognizer` class now retrieves UI elements from the shared list using the `GetAllElements` method of the `UiElementList` class. The `AddElement` and `RemoveElement` methods of the `UiElementList` class are thread-safe thanks to the use of a `lock` statement, which ensures that only one thread can access the list at a time.

