Here is an example of how to use Flask-SSO to add SSO support to a Flask app:
```
from flask import Flask, redirect, url_for
from flask_sso import SSO

app = Flask(__name__)
app.config['SSO_ENDPOINT'] = 'https://your-sso-provider.com/sso'
app.config['SSO_CLIENT_ID'] = 'your-client-id'
app.config['SSO_CLIENT_SECRET'] = 'your-client-secret'

