V. Writing the Current Time to a File

1. In the "startShifuProc" method of the "ShifuService" class, we are writing the current time to the file "/data/data/com.example.shifuapp/files/shifutime.txt". However, we need to make sure that the file exists before writing to it. Modify the "startShifuProc" method as follows:
```vbnet
private void startShifuProc() {
    File shifuTimeFile = new File(getFilesDir(), "shifutime.txt");
    if (!shifuTimeFile.exists()) {
        try {
            shifuTimeFile.createNewFile();
        } catch (IOException e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        }
    }

    try {
        Runtime.getRuntime().exec("sh -c \"while true; do date >> " + shifuTimeFile.getAbsolutePath() + "; sleep 1; done\"");
    } catch (IOException e) {
        e.printStackTrace();
    }
}
```
